# System-0001: N=1 Longitudinal Longevity & Physiological Dataset

> **Project Code**: System-0001  
> **Subject Profile**: 65yo Male (De-identified N=1 Self-Tracking)  
> **Core Objective**: Rigorous tracking, auditing, and open-source optimization of sleep architecture, autonomic nervous function, biomechanical load, and metabolic longevity protocols.

---

## 🔬 Project Overview (项目概述)
This repository hosts the longitudinal $N=1$ physiological dataset and protocol documentation of **System-0001**. The system integrates wearable biometrics, circadian metabolic rules (e.g., Time-Restricted Eating, targeted leucine optimization), and biomechanical gait auditing (e.g., full-roll gait and mechanical load management) to target healthy lifespan extension.

本仓库用于开源和记录 System-0001 的纵向 $N=1$ 生理数据集与抗衰干预协议，涵盖睡眠修复、神经能效（HRV）、昼夜血压、物理运动负荷与营养干预等多维时序数据。

