## 📊 Dataset Structure (数据集结构)
Data is structured in standardized CSV format (`data/weekly_log.csv`), adhering to tidy data principles. Key modules include:
1. **Sleep Architecture**: Onset time, total duration, core/deep/REM sleep stages, nocturia count.
2. **Autonomic & Vitality**: RMSSD (App/Watch), resting heart rate, SpO2, wrist temperature offset, vitality scores.
3. **Blood Pressure**: Morning and evening 3-consecutive-reading averages.
4. **Physical Load (Lagged alignment to next morning)**: Walking distance, speed, step asymmetry, double support time, targeted functional training.
5. **Nutrition & Body Composition**: Fasting window, morning sea bass + L-leucine matrix, muscle mass %, BMI, BMR.

